  #line-at(134.765pt, 440.618pt, "modest wavelength dependence of the performance of ultrafast laser ablation in di-")
  #line-at(134.765pt, 452.573pt, "electrics from the ultraviolet to the mid-infrared domain. However, the wavelength is")
  #line-at(134.765pt, 464.528pt, "a unique control parameter on the period of surface and in-volume nanostructures, as")
  #line-at(134.765pt, 476.483pt, "well as on the performance of laser-written waveguides. Combining ultrashort pulses")
  #line-at(134.765pt, 488.438pt, "at different wavelengths can also represent a smart approach to individually control")
  #line-at(134.765pt, 500.394pt, "different")
  #line-at(171.786pt, 500.394pt, "mechanisms")
